# The deployable surface is web/ — vercel.json sets "outputDirectory": "web",
# and there is no build step. Everything else in this repo is the iOS app,
# MCP tooling, and build artifacts, none of which Vercel needs.
#
# Without this file the upload was 443.8 MB / 16,092 files, which blew both
# the 15,000-file limit and then the build container's memory (SIGKILL).
/*

# ...except the site itself and its config.
!/web
!/vercel.json

# package.json must ship: without it Vercel's zero-config detection cannot
# identify the project and falls back to a Node server, failing with
# "No entrypoint found". The lockfile keeps the install deterministic.
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
